<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Catppuccin pour Cinnamon</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; background: transparent; }
  body { font-family: var(--font-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif); color: var(--foreground, #1e1e2e); padding: 0; }
  .intro { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .intro h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .intro p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted-foreground, #6c6f85); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 72ch; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .card { background: var(--cc-base); color: var(--cc-text); border: 1px solid var(--cc-surface1); border-radius: var(--radius, 8px); padding: 16px; min-width: 0; }
  .card-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .card h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .kind { display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--cc-surface1); color: var(--cc-subtext0); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .swatches { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; justify-content: flex-end; max-width: 142px; }
  .swatch { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; display: block; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
  .preview { border-radius: calc(var(--radius, 8px) - 2px); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--cc-surface0); background: var(--cc-base); }
  .preview svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 12px; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--cc-subtext0); font-size: 10.5px; }
  .meta b { color: var(--cc-text); font-weight: 600; }
  .meta code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace); font-size: 10px; color: var(--cc-subtext0); }
  .install { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 12px; margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border, #ccd0da); border-radius: var(--radius, 8px); background: var(--secondary, #e6e9ef); color: var(--secondary-foreground, #4c4f69); font-size: 12px; }
  .install code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace); color: var(--foreground, #1e1e2e); background: var(--card, #eff1f5); border: 1px solid var(--border, #ccd0da); border-radius: calc(var(--radius, 8px) - 4px); padding: 3px 7px; }
  .install span { color: var(--muted-foreground, #6c6f85); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="intro">
    <h1>Catppuccin pour Cinnamon</h1>
    <p>Quatre thèmes complets pour l'interface Cinnamon de Linux Mint — panneau, menu, applets, listes de fenêtres, notifications, dialogues et écran de verrouillage. Palette officielle Catppuccin, accent <code>{{ACCENT}}</code> (modifiable avec <code>--accent</code>).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
{{CARDS}}
  </div>
  <div class="install">
    <code>./scripts/install.sh</code>
    <span>Installe les quatre variantes dans <code>~/.themes</code>. Choisissez ensuite le thème dans Paramètres → Thèmes, puis Ctrl+Alt+Échap si nécessaire.</span>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
